  "prefLabel": "Pol 101.35 Probationary period",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pol 101.35 \"Probationary period\" means employment as a police or corrections officer for a period of 12 consecutive months with a single agency.\n\nSource. #5836, eff 6-15-94; ss by #7301, eff 6-8-00; ss by #9222, eff 8-1-08",
